# A bad-bot list that does what the generated one should: it refuses the bots and the HTTP
# libraries it names, and nothing a site wants. A pattern file, as the generated one is, for
# `acl bad_bot hdr(user-agent) -m reg -i -f /etc/haproxy/waf/bots.acl`. The test runs it first,
# so that the checks on the bad-bot list are shown to pass on a list that is right.
sqlmap
AhrefsBot
SemrushBot
MJ12bot
curl
python-requests
Go-http-client
okhttp
Dart/
node-fetch
axios
^Java/
PostmanRuntime
Wget
HTTPie
